/                                                                               
/      ADVENTURE PROGRAM -- DATABASE                                            
/                                                                               
/                                                                               
/      DESCRIPTION OF THE DATABASE FORMAT                                       
/                                                                               
/                                                                               
/      THE DATA FILE CONTAINS SEVERAL SECTIONS.  EACH BEGINS WITH A LINE        
/      CONTAINING A NUMBER IDENTIFYING THE SECTION, AND ENDS WITH A LINE        
/      CONTAINING "-1".                                                         
/                                                                               
/                                                                               
/      SECTION 1: LONG FORM DESCRIPTIONS.  EACH LINE CONTAINS A LOCATION        
/           NUMBER, A SPACE, AND A LINE OF TEXT.  THE SET OF (NECESSARILY       
/           ADJACENT) LINES WHOSE NUMBERS ARE X FORM THE LONG DESCRIPTION       
/           OF LOCATION X.                                                      
/                                                                               
